    "updated_at": "2021-03-06T21:40:00Z",
    "body": "I noticed you added (non-tentative) tests for something very similar in https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/blob/master/selection/contenteditable/collapse.html . I.e. you assumed that when the `selection.collapse()` method modified the selection, it would also change the document's `activeElement`. That appears to be true in Gecko but [only sometimes true in other engines](https://wpt.fyi/results/selection/contenteditable/collapse.html?label=master&label=experimental&product=chrome&product=firefox&product=safari&aligned&q=collapse).",
