    "updated_at": "2021-03-06T22:01:55Z",
    "body": "Hmm, yeah, that sounds similar but it seems to be a contenteditable side bug as `<div contenteditable><div contenteditable=false></div></div>` is clickable on Gecko and not on Blink.\r\n\r\nAdding some characters right inside `host3` makes it succeed on all engines, so that should be the task here. (And probably should copy the current characterless ones to `/editing` as tentative tests with a spec issue.)",
